  "question": "Which attraction can be found within 200 kilometers while moving north from Bowditch Middle School Auditorium, Foster City, CA?",
  "sql": "\nWITH origin AS  (SELECT ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-122.248613 37.559053)',4326)::geography AS geometry)\nSELECT * FROM pois, origin\nWHERE ST_DWithin(pois.geometry, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-122.248613 37.559053)',4326)::geography, 200000)\nAND tourism = 'attraction'\nAND ((degrees(ST_Azimuth(origin.geometry, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN 0.0 AND 22.5) OR (degrees(ST_Azimuth(origin.geometry, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN 337.5 AND 360));\n",
